{"translation-revision-date":"2025-02-05 09:24-0500","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.11.0","source":"dist\/js\/interface.RETIRE-SAVINGS.gpl.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"en":["fr"],"Please use the backspace key to delete.":["Veuillez utiliser la touche d'effacement pour supprimer."],"Left, up & down arrow keys are disabled. So are the home, end, pgup and pgdn keys.":["Les touches fl\u00e9ch\u00e9es gauche, haut et bas sont d\u00e9sactiv\u00e9es, ainsi que les touches Home, End, PgUp et PgDn."],"Use backspace to delete.":["Utilisez la touche d'effacement pour supprimer."],"If value is selected, just start typing new value to clear prior value.":["Si la valeur est s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9e, il suffit de commencer \u00e0 taper la nouvelle valeur pour effacer la valeur pr\u00e9c\u00e9dente."],"When a number is selected (value shown in inverse), use right arrow key to clear selection without clearing value. Then backspace to edit.":["Lorsqu'un nombre est s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9 (valeur affich\u00e9e en inverse), utilisez la touche fl\u00e9ch\u00e9e droite pour effacer la s\u00e9lection sans effacer la valeur. Ensuite, utilisez la touche Retour arri\u00e8re (backspace) pour modifier."],"TIP: Generally it is best to use the TAB or SHIFT-TAB keys to move from one input to the next or previous input.":["CONSEIL : En g\u00e9n\u00e9ral, il est pr\u00e9f\u00e9rable d'utiliser les touches TAB ou SHIFT-TAB pour passer d'une entr\u00e9e \u00e0 la suivante ou \u00e0 la pr\u00e9c\u00e9dente."],"TIP 2: Generally, editing a value is inefficient. Since values are auto selected, just type the number you want.":["ASTUCE 2 : En g\u00e9n\u00e9ral, l'\u00e9dition d'une valeur est inefficace. Comme les valeurs sont s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9es automatiquement, il suffit de taper le nombre que vous voulez."],"Do not type the thousand separator character.":["Ne tapez pas le caract\u00e8re s\u00e9parateur de milliers."],"(If using U.S. convention, that would be the comma.)":["(Si vous utilisez la convention am\u00e9ricaine, ce serait la virgule.)"],"I'm smart enough to enter them for you!":["Je suis assez intelligent pour les saisir pour vous !"],"An unknown date calculation error occurred.":["Une erreur de calcul de date inconnue s'est produite."],"Please provide us with your inputs and settings so that we can fix this. Thank you.":["Veuillez nous fournir vos donn\u00e9es et param\u00e8tres afin que nous puissions r\u00e9soudre ce probl\u00e8me. Merci."],"Date is not valid - bad year.":["La date n'est pas valide - mauvaise ann\u00e9e."],"Jan":["janv."],"Feb":["F\u00e9v"],"Mar":["Mars"],"Apr":["Avr"],"May":["Mai"],"Jun":["Juin"],"Jul":["Juil"],"Aug":["Ao\u00fbt"],"Sept":["Sept."],"Oct":["Oct."],"Nov":["Nov."],"Dec":["D\u00e9c."],"Error: dates out of sequence.":["Erreur : les dates ne sont pas dans l'ordre."],"Exception":["Exception"],"occurred when accessing":["s'est produit lors de l'acc\u00e8s"],"Invalid index":["Indice invalide"],"YTD":["Cumul annuel"],"Running Totals":["Totaux cumul\u00e9s"],"Your Personalized Retirement Schedule":["Votre \u00e9ch\u00e9ancier de retraite personnalis\u00e9"],"Retirement Plan Summary":["R\u00e9sum\u00e9 du plan de retraite"],"Total Investment":["Investissement total"],"Number of Investments":["Nombre d'investissements"],"Return on Investment (ROI)":["Retour sur investissement (RSI)"],"Total Gain":["Gain total"],"Gain on Investment":["Gain sur l'investissement"],"Last Cash Flow Date":["Date du dernier flux de tr\u00e9sorerie"],"Years":["Ann\u00e9es"],"Investment Schedule":["\u00c9ch\u00e9ancier d'investissement"],"Year":["Ann\u00e9e"],"Date":["Date"],"Investment":["Investissement"],"Investment Gain":["Gain d'investissement"],"Net Change":["Changement net"],"Balance":["Solde"],"Annual Investment":["Investissement annuel"],"Annual Interest":["Int\u00e9r\u00eat annuel"],"Annual Investment Gain":["Gain annuel sur l'investissement"],"Change in Balance":["Changement dans le solde"],"Annual Investment and Interest Totals":["Totaux annuels des investissements et des int\u00e9r\u00eats"],"Accumulated Investment and Interest":["Investissement et int\u00e9r\u00eats cumul\u00e9s"],"Amount Invested & Interest as Percentage of Total Value":["Montant investi et int\u00e9r\u00eats en pourcentage de la valeur totale"],"\"Net Change\" is change from prior period i.e. prior balance plus investment, plus gain on investment (interest).":["La \"variation nette\" est la variation par rapport \u00e0 la p\u00e9riode pr\u00e9c\u00e9dente, c'est-\u00e0-dire le solde ant\u00e9rieur plus les investissements, plus les gains sur les investissements (int\u00e9r\u00eats)."],"Running Investment":["Investissement cumul\u00e9"],"Running Interest":["Int\u00e9r\u00eat cumul\u00e9"],"Running Investment Gain":["Gain d'investissement cumul\u00e9"],"Total Deposits":["Total des d\u00e9p\u00f4ts"],"Total Interest Earned":["Total des int\u00e9r\u00eats per\u00e7us"],"Total Value":["Valeur totale"],"Pct. of Total":["% du total"],"Your Personalized Cash Flow Schedule":["Votre calendrier de tr\u00e9sorerie personnalis\u00e9"],"Current age must be greater than 0.":["L'\u00e2ge actuel doit \u00eatre sup\u00e9rieur \u00e0 0."],"\"Retirement Age\" must be greater than \"Current Age\"":["L'\"\u00e2ge de la retraite\" doit \u00eatre sup\u00e9rieur \u00e0 l'\"\u00e2ge actuel\""],"Retirement Savings Calculator \u2014 calculate savings required to reach retirement goal":["Calculatrice d'\u00c9pargne pour la Retraite - calculer l'\u00e9pargne n\u00e9cessaire pour atteindre l'objectif de retraite"],"<p>This calculator easily answers the question \"Given the value of my current investments how much do I need to save each month to reach my retirement goal?\"<\/p>":["<p>Cette calculatrice r\u00e9pond facilement \u00e0 la question \"\u00c9tant donn\u00e9 la valeur de mes investissements actuels, combien dois-je \u00e9pargner chaque mois pour atteindre mon objectif de retraite ?\"<\/p>"],"<p>The user enters their \"Current Age\", their expected \"Retirement Age\", the \"Annual Interest Rate (ROR)\" (annualized Rate-of-Return one expects to earn) and \"Amount At Retirement\" (the goal amount).<\/p>":["<p>L'utilisateur entre son \"\u00c2ge actuel\", son \"\u00c2ge de retraite\" pr\u00e9vu, le \"Taux d'int\u00e9r\u00eat annuel (ROR)\" (taux de rendement annuel attendu) et le \"Montant \u00e0 la retraite\" (le montant cible).<\/p>"],"<p class=\"tail\">The calculator quickly calculates the required monthly investment amount and creates an investment schedule plus a set of charts that will help the user see the relationship between the amount invested and the return on the investment.<\/p>":["<p class=\"tail\">La calculatrice calcule rapidement le montant de l'investissement mensuel requis et cr\u00e9e un calendrier d'investissement ainsi qu'un ensemble de graphiques qui aident l'utilisateur \u00e0 visualiser la relation entre le montant investi et le rendement.<\/p>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">If you need a more advanced \"Retirement Calculator\" - one that calculates many more unknowns and one that calculates assuming retirement <b>income<\/b> and not a final lump sum then try the calculator located here: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/retirement-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Si vous avez besoin d'une \"Calculatrice de retraite\" plus avanc\u00e9e - une qui calcule de nombreuses inconnues suppl\u00e9mentaires et qui calcule en supposant un <b>revenu<\/b> de retraite et non un capital unique, essayez la calculatrice situ\u00e9e ici : <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/retirement-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Need more options including the ability to solve for other unknowns? Ability to create, in one schedule, the pre-retirement and post-retirement cashflow? Print the chart? Export to MS Word&trade; (.docx) or MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) files? Please visit, <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/retirement-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Besoin de plus d'options, y compris la capacit\u00e9 de r\u00e9soudre d'autres inconnues ? Capacit\u00e9 de cr\u00e9er, dans un seul calendrier, le flux de tr\u00e9sorerie avant et apr\u00e8s la retraite ? Imprimer le graphique ? Exporter vers des fichiers MS Word&trade; (.docx) ou MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) ? Veuillez visiter, <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/retirement-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"Prepared for":["Pr\u00e9par\u00e9 pour"],"Address":["Adresse"],"City, State  ZIP":["Ville, \u00c9tat  Code Postal"],"Prepared On":["Pr\u00e9par\u00e9 le"],"Prepared by":["Pr\u00e9par\u00e9 par"],"Phone":["T\u00e9l\u00e9phone"],"Email":["E-mail"],"Website":["Site web"],"Unknown":["Inconnu"],"u":["i"],"U":["I"],"Dates must be the first of the month.":["Les dates doivent \u00eatre le premier jour du mois."],"An invalid JavaScript date object.":["Un objet de date JavaScript non valide."],"Monthly":["Mensuel"]}}}